title Blackwing Lair (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 60-60
zone Burning Steppes
pitch Blackwing Lair, in Burning Steppes. A raid.
why Every Alliance quest of Blackwing Lair: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Burning Steppes: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

